+| S24 | semantic.k:41 | `ISeq ::= Int :: ISeq [symbol(seqCons)]` | Nonempty integer-sequence constructor. |
+| S25 | semantic.k:43 | `PyVal ::= pyInt(Int)` | Integer value constructor. |
