+| S02 | semantic.k:8 | `Stmts ::= List{Stmt, ""}` | Honest juxtaposed statement-list representation. |
+| S03 | semantic.k:9 | `Stmt ::= FuncDef(String, Params, Stmts)` | Covers the submitted function definition. |
